/* Accessibility */
"辅助功能" = "Accessibility";
"未授权 — 「切换隐藏文件」需重启访达，会关闭所有访达窗口" = "Not granted — \"Toggle Hidden Files\" must restart Finder, closing all Finder windows";
"FinderRight 用「辅助功能」权限模拟 Cmd+Shift+. 快捷键，无需重启访达即可切换隐藏文件；剪切、粘贴快捷键也需要它。未授权时只能重启访达，会关闭所有访达窗口，并可能中断正在进行的拷贝或移动。" = "FinderRight uses Accessibility to simulate the Cmd+Shift+. shortcut, toggling hidden files without restarting Finder. Cut and paste shortcuts need it too. Without it, Finder has to restart, which closes all Finder windows and may interrupt copies or moves in progress.";
"打开辅助功能设置…" = "Open Accessibility Settings…";
